      "text": "太陰與太陽相對，也算「日月合璧」：你的家道興隆，任職的機構也興旺。",
      "en": "Tai Yin facing Tai Yang, what the old books call sun and moon joined: your household prospers, and so does the organisation you work for.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.田宅.太陽.1",
        "quote": "此意亦可用于服务机构"
